[{"client_msg_id":"f2e036ee-abe0-4fd8-b030-6b492469bcfd","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`git status`のヘルプ読んで `git status -u all -- \u0026lt;pathspec\u0026gt;`で指定したディレクトリにある gitignore されていないファイルのstatusを見れると知った。","ts":"1629814421.150700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UL6CFN8NR","UD1FQV38V","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDP2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5993DCF1-20D9-463C-A912-2AFDC2CAED3A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"新規ディレクトリは怖くてなかなか一気に追加できないですね。","ts":"1629814015.149300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U78A6ESHM","U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlsC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfff5985-3302-425f-afea-f555c880d1ca","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`git config --global commit.verbose true`もできるのか。便利そうですね。ただdiffがでかいと重そうだから常時 `true`は微妙なんですかねえ。","ts":"1629813544.144800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zg9w7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d7634b3-9743-45a4-9495-a04a8da96126","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あ、statusじゃなかったdiffだった","ts":"1629813384.143500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fzFwk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c443c408-c1f9-4e21-94c5-b7c1804605a1","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`git commit`で `status`は見れて、`-v`つけると `diff` も見れるっぽいですね。","ts":"1629813369.143200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ve6+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6252ccf-d953-4075-8b0d-7e1964854da3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば `git commit -v` を実行するとコミット時にstatusが見れて便利","ts":"1629813180.142500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61FJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19bb4dc8-a451-4694-bf3d-6d3a13efa5cf","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"一括でやるのは更新分だけにしてますね `git add -u` 。それも念のため `git status`見ますが……。 `git add .`はディレクトリ追加時に予見しなかったファイルを大量に追加しちゃうことがあるので、避けてます。","ts":"1629813132.142000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9njb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DF5145AD-0FE6-4953-9244-A8F5B3E689CD","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"git add . の前に git status は見ないの？","ts":"1629811780.139800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1wV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db0105bc-f541-4f3d-a945-e7fb6bf88f36","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私は自分の物だろうが全部一々個別にaddしてるな(だからこそgina.vimが手放せないのですが)","ts":"1629810639.138900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7mqqG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75873b7c-abc3-4797-8978-f5be3c48e840","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ふだん自分用のプログラムしか書かないので`git add .` でやっちゃう","ts":"1629810518.138200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BbqG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"213fd9e2-cfcf-4393-8c18-711990a7afc6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"便利ツールをｼｭｯと書いてライブラリ化して社内に共有したところでgitignoreを忘れていてなんもかんも含まれたことに気付く、をやった","ts":"1629810447.137200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Potax"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80c3f678-0f8b-4310-80fd-b8b1ecf95975","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、ちゃんとなってたw","ts":"1629809501.134900","thread_ts":"1629708156.114900","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VFb"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"9e654673-11f3-4696-a2ff-2